Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  菲比  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe. Phoebe. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他们搞在一起了  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, they're doing it! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道  你知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I know. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我知道  乔伊也知道  但罗斯不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I know, and Joey knows, but Ross doesn't...
