Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是好兴奋  你要搬到这里来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, we're just so excited that you might get this apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的确很棒  很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, it looks really good. Aah! It looks pretty good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到这儿来  快过来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get in here! Come on!
