Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说每次摩妮卡和钱德  像这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean whenever Monica and Chandler were, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去洗衣服或买东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...doing laundry or going grocery shopping...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她每次跟伤心的琳达讲电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All that time Monica spent on the phone with sad Linda from camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿咻  嘿咻  色情电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. Doing it, doing it, phone doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  真是太好了  对男方来说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I think it's great. For him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女方可以有更好的对象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She might be able to do better.
