Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说他们是朋友  如此而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean how they're friends and nothing more?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  乔伊  她知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, Joey, she knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚才在丑裸男的公寓  看到他们隔着窗户在做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were at Ugly Naked Guy's apartment and saw them doing it through the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该说是  靠着窗户在做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, we saw them doing it up against the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道你知道  但是不知道瑞秋知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so now they know you know, and they don't know Rachel knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但现在这些都不重要了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but you know what? It doesn't matter who knows what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有三个人知道  就可以告诉他们了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now enough of us know that we could just tell them we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不必说谎保密了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now all the lying and the secrets will finally be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者我们也可以不告诉他们  自己来找点乐子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or we could not tell them we know and have a little fun of our own.
