Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,譬如每次他们说要洗衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, every time they say they're doing laundry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就给他们一堆衣服洗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we'll give them laundry to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I would enjoy that. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  瑞秋  你知道怎么更好玩吗  告诉他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, Rach, you know what would be even more fun? Telling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我想照菲比的做法  我没办法再\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, no, I want to do Phoebe's thing. I can't take any--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要别说我们知道就行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't have to do anything. Just don't tell them that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  我没办法再保密了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I can't take any more secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有你们的秘密  他们的秘密  还有我自己的秘密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got your secrets, I got their secrets. I got secrets of my own, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才没有秘密  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't have any secrets. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.97,0:04:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就不知道  我有个企鹅抱枕叫抱宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you don't know about Hugsy, my bedtime penguin pal.
