Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.45,0:04:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的性感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My sexuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, children. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看  学着点  别吃我的饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Watch, learn, and don't eat my cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你穿这件外套真好看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. Wow, that jacket looks great on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  对  这个料子摸起来好软\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah. The material looks so soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  二头肌先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hello, Mr. Bicep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在健身吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've been working out?
