Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的想知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you really wanna know--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can't tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  是我  你什么都可以告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, it's me, you can tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我就是不能告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, actually, you're the one person I can't tell this to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我又最想告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the one person I want to the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我很久没跟男人在一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's just, you know, that I haven't been with a guy in so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时你一直寻寻觅觅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you know how sometimes you're looking for something...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却没发现他就在你眼前喝咖啡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you don't see that it's right there in front of you, sipping coffee...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说太多了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. Have I said too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之你考虑一下  我就会考虑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, just something to think about. I know I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are so cute. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会这么可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did you get to be so cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爷爷是瑞典人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, my grandfather was Swedish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我奶奶其实是只拇指兔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And my grandmother was actually a tiny little bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你变得更可爱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now you're even cuter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这简直是今天的民意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, that is a popular opinion today, I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天在咖啡厅发生了件怪事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The weirdest thing happened at the coffeehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得菲比在钓我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think Phoebe was hitting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.43,0:06:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是真的  菲比觉得我很有魅力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm telling you, I think Phoebe thinks I'm foxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not possible. Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:07:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  只是在菲比眼中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, it's just Phoebe's just always thought you were charming...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的迷人是无性的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in a sexless kind of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种话真是百听不厌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, you know, I can't hear that enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你应该误解她的意思了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, I just think you misunderstood her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有误解  好吗  她只差没扑上来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I didn't misunderstand, okay? She was all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还摸我的二头肌呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She touched my bicep, for crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这块二头肌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This bicep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  我现在没挤它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's not flexed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你要干什么  要不要一起去看电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Mon, what are you doing? Want to come see a movie with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我正要去洗衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, actually, I was going to do some laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  要不要起去  好啊  我跟你一起去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, you want to do it with me? Sure, I'll do it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, great. Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.78,0:07:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unh. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不介意吧  这样我就轻松多了  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't mind, do you? That would really help me out a lot. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.75,0:07:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样  我的硬币应该不够\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. You know what? I don't think I have enough quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.33,0:07:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这里有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I have quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯  公寓申请得怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, Ross, any word on the apartment yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打过去问  原来丑裸男要自己转租\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I called over there, and it turns out Ugly Naked Guy is subletting it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且已经有一大堆申请者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And he's already had like 100 applicants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之差别是我占了优势\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. No, no, I've got the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这样有点奸诈  但我送了点东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know it's not exactly ethical, but I sent him a bribe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去贿赂他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to tip the scales in my direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从窗户搞不好看得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Check it out, you can see it from the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那个打了蝴蝶结的弹珠台吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, is it that pinball machine with the big bow on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那辆新的登山车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That new mountain bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你送什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what did you send?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一篮小英式松饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A basket of mini muffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但桌上全都是小英式松饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a whole table of mini muffin baskets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪一篮是你送的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which one did you send?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小的那一篮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你真以为那篮松饼  能帮你争取到公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You actually thought that basket was gonna get you the apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们办公室曾经收到一篮  大家都爱得不得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Someone sent us a basket at work once and people went crazy over those muffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天真的很高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was the best day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的工作让我觉得好悲惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your work makes me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的  我好想要那间公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man, I want that place so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.49,0:09:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为一定会成功\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I was so sure that was going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那12块算是丢到水里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's 12 bucks I'll never see again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.41,0:09:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  想看电影就得快了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, we'd better go if we're gonna catch that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  再见  我已经开始想你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye, Chandler. I miss you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到她了  嗲里嗲气  还捏我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, did you see that? With the inappropriate, and the pinching?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信她对我有意思了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So now do you believe that she's attracted to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  她知道我们的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Oh, my God. She knows about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的还假的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比知道了  她想吓我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe knows, and she's just trying to freak us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.86,0:09:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是唯一的解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the only explanation for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我好捏的屁股和激凸的二头肌呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but what about my pinchable butt and my bulging biceps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比知道我们的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe knows about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没告诉她们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I didn't tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们  "她们"是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Them? Who's "them"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比和乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Phoebe and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你们  但她们逼我不能说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I would have told you, but they made me promise not to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那现在没事了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, hey, it's over now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以告诉她们你们知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you can tell them you know they know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就可以恢复我状况外的本色了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I can go back to knowing absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非  没有"除非"  现在就要了结\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless-No, not "unless." This must end now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们还自以为高明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man, they think they are so slick messing with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们不知道我们知道她们知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But they don't know that we know that they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So. Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耍人的要变成被耍的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The messers become the mes-sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  别再折磨自己了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Ross, honey, you gotta stop torturing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不去找别的公寓嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you just find another apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这个月已经看了上千间公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've already looked at like a thousand apartments this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有哪一间比得上那一间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}None of them even compares to that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你应该怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what you should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.02,0:11:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该找出他的嗜好  拿来跟他套交情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should find out what his hobbies are and then use that to bond with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,例如我对乔伊有所求\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Like if I wanted something from Joey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会聊  三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I would strike up a conversation about, say, urn, sandwiches...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是我的内衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or, uh, my underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒的主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我了解丑裸男  因为我们偷窥了他5年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I know Ugly Naked Guy because we've been watching him for five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我又重新占了上风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that gives me back my edge. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  他有一张跳床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's see now. He had the trampoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被他跳坏了  他有双倒吊鞋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But he broke that. Well, he had gravity boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也被他穿坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, he broke those too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他喜欢破坏东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So he likes to break stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我得去接小班  不过我会想出来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I've got to go pick up Ben, but I will figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他之前不是有一只猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, didn't he used to have a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:11:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别提那个  会害他心情不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wouldn't bring that up. It would probably just bum him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的猫咪  没看到大屁股压下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Poor cat never saw that big butt coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在  等一下  她就在旁边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, hey. Hold on a second, she's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我一整天都在想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Phoebe, I've been thinking about you all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前的提议  说我不心动是骗人的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know that thing you said before? I'd be lying if I said I wasn't intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  听着  乔伊晚上不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Listen, Joey won't be here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要过来  我让你模我的二头肌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you come over and I'll let you, uh, feel my bicep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者是别的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我待会再给你答覆  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll have to get back to you on that. Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  他找我去模他的二头肌和别的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. He wants me to come over and feel his bicep and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧  是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他居然背着摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I cannot believe he would do that to Mon--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  他们知道我们知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey? Do they know that we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道你们知道了  我就知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They know you know. Ooh, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那两个人真扯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I cannot believe those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们以为他们可以耍我们  想耍我们是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, they thought they can mess with us! They're trying to mess with us?! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不知道我们知道  他们知道我们知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They don't know that we know they know we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你不能说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, Joey, you can't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't even if I wanted too.
